# reference exactly so reconstitution auto-fills), sub, cls, evi/evicls, reg/regcls,
# ruo, what, mech (HTML), evidence (HTML), reg_html (HTML), refs, optional disc.
# eviCls: b-evi (early/preclinical, purple) | b-evi-trial (clinical/approved, blue)
# regCls: b-reg (RUO/investigational, amber) | b-reg-ok (approved, green)

